@startuml sequence-password-reset
title Password Reset Flow

actor User
participant AuthController
participant PasswordResetService
participant UserRepository
participant EmailService
participant JwtService

== Solicitação ==
User -> AuthController : POST /hf/auth/forgot-password(ForgotPasswordDTO)
AuthController -> PasswordResetService : requestPasswordReset(email)
PasswordResetService -> UserRepository : findByEmail(email)

alt e-mail cadastrado
  PasswordResetService -> PasswordResetService : gera token 6 dígitos
  PasswordResetService -> UserRepository : save(token, expiresAt)
  PasswordResetService -> EmailService : sendPasswordResetEmail(email, token)
end

PasswordResetService --> AuthController : MessageDTO
AuthController --> User : 200 mensagem genérica

== Redefinição ==
User -> AuthController : PATCH /hf/auth/reset-password(ResetPasswordDTO)
AuthController -> PasswordResetService : resetPassword(token, newPassword)
PasswordResetService -> UserRepository : findByPasswordResetToken(token)

alt token válido e não expirado
  PasswordResetService -> PasswordResetService : encode(newPassword)
  PasswordResetService -> UserRepository : save(clear token)
  PasswordResetService -> JwtService : generateToken(user)
  JwtService --> PasswordResetService : JWT
  PasswordResetService --> AuthController : TokenDTO
  AuthController --> User : 200 TokenDTO
else token inválido ou expirado
  PasswordResetService --> AuthController : BadCredentialsException
  AuthController --> User : 400
end

@enduml
